  "NewsContent": "<div class=\"ExternalClass17858DC78E244F3FBFADF617BBCF38C6\"><p>\u200bDr Anwar Gilani has been awarded the Sitara-i-Imtiaz, a prestigious civil award, by the government of Pakistan. Professor Gilani, an expert in natural products pharmacology, joined AKU in 1985.</p></div>",
